--- !u!114 &248216713
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 248216710}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Unfeathered.
    - I saw your fall from the wire. To find you here, alive, perplexes me.
    - Do you see her light surround us? You tread on hallowed ground.
    - Your kind has no business going any further.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - What purpose have you in this place, I wonder?
    - The spirit of this land has long since withered away. There is nothing for
      you here.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - Her will prevents the unworthy from continuing. You should turn back.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
  DialogueName: Savaphe
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 370110605}
  CameraY: 0.5
